509
00:22:30,330 --> 00:22:32,090
How about now?

510
00:22:32,090 --> 00:22:34,010
Is it a device, or
is it not a device?

511
00:22:37,110 --> 00:22:39,373
Trick question,
obviously, because there

512
00:22:39,373 --> 00:22:41,040
