can build off of it.

527
00:23:11,070 --> 00:23:15,310
And so there are strategic
ways of thinking about it.

528
00:23:15,310 --> 00:23:18,230
So the crazy thing here,
if you can imagine this,

529
00:23:18,230 --> 00:23:23,600
