909
00:40:08,130 --> 00:40:11,660
sets that you can use
that are anonymized

910
00:40:11,660 --> 00:40:14,200
to what is an acceptable level.

911
00:40:14,200 --> 00:40:16,450
But to Andy's point,
there's really

912
00:40:16,450 --> 00:40:21,960
